WEBVTT

00:03.160 --> 00:06.770
Fight for your justice,
show your courage.

00:06.770 --> 00:10.370
Right! Grasp truth in these hands.

00:10.370 --> 00:13.780
Fight for your justice, I want you

00:13.780 --> 00:21.200
as you fight through
with your head held up high.

00:35.860 --> 00:39.930
Rather than polishing diamonds

00:43.040 --> 00:46.970
give me a glistening future.

00:50.250 --> 00:52.480
Even if nothing's there, get up.

00:52.480 --> 00:56.350
It's important to turn on the switch.

00:57.450 --> 01:00.220
Something new that I don't want to yield.

01:00.220 --> 01:04.750
Seeking it is justice!

01:06.360 --> 01:09.930
Fight for your justice,
be serious about it.

01:09.930 --> 01:13.540
Right! Face reality head on.

01:13.540 --> 01:16.940
Fight for your justice,
I love how you

01:16.940 --> 01:27.340
never give up even if
the current is against you.

01:40.560 --> 01:42.200
Ms. Gasco...

01:42.200 --> 01:43.630
Ms. Gasco!

01:48.970 --> 01:52.010
The delivery ship...
signal has been lost.

01:52.010 --> 01:52.640
Ezra!

01:52.640 --> 01:54.040
R-Right!

01:54.040 --> 01:56.510
Ms. Gasco, please respond!

01:56.510 --> 01:59.480
Ms. Gasco! Ms. Gasco!

02:11.460 --> 02:13.230
Damn you all...

02:13.230 --> 02:14.890
I'll kill all of you!

02:21.500 --> 02:23.160
Why?

02:24.810 --> 02:26.810
Don't mock me...

02:26.810 --> 02:29.110
I'll kill each and every one!

02:29.110 --> 02:31.200
Don't, Mr. Alien!

02:33.750 --> 02:35.380
Everyone, pull back!

02:35.380 --> 02:36.450
Shut up!

02:36.450 --> 02:37.920
Don't get in my way!

02:37.920 --> 02:41.290
No way can we win if we stay hotheaded!

02:41.290 --> 02:43.420
That's not something you can say!

02:51.030 --> 02:52.690
Hot!

02:57.710 --> 02:59.370
What is it?

03:01.910 --> 03:03.510
Why did you come out?

03:03.510 --> 03:04.650
I don't know!

03:04.650 --> 03:07.450
This thing changed the route on its own!

03:07.450 --> 03:09.780
I burned myself...

03:09.780 --> 03:11.250
Ms. Gasco!

03:11.250 --> 03:13.560
Please respond, Ms. Gasco!

03:13.560 --> 03:15.020
It's okay.

03:15.020 --> 03:16.690
But...

03:16.690 --> 03:19.060
That's enough...

03:24.930 --> 03:28.600
I've picked up an expansive,
high-density gas nebula

03:28.600 --> 03:30.760
on Nirvana's flight path.

03:33.270 --> 03:35.040
We've entered the gas nebula.

03:35.040 --> 03:37.980
Experiencing heavy
effects on the systems.

03:49.720 --> 03:52.530
We've completed docking all the Dreads.

03:52.530 --> 03:54.100
Thanks for the hard work.

03:54.100 --> 03:57.430
I'm sorry, but about Ms. Gasco...

03:57.430 --> 03:58.730
It's all right now...

03:58.730 --> 03:59.730
But...

03:59.730 --> 04:01.270
That's enough!

04:01.270 --> 04:03.260
Just be on standby.

04:04.910 --> 04:06.570
Roger.

04:07.540 --> 04:10.180
I thought I was strong enough...

04:10.180 --> 04:12.910
to not be fazed by anything.

04:28.860 --> 04:30.130
As I thought.

04:30.130 --> 04:34.500
What happened to Gascogne is
having a huge effect on the crew.

04:34.500 --> 04:37.810
Especially because
it was someone close to them...

04:37.810 --> 04:39.870
However...

04:39.870 --> 04:42.810
What Gascogne left behind is huge.

04:42.810 --> 04:45.910
She created a gaping
hole in their mothership.

04:45.910 --> 04:48.650
That means we still
have a way out of this!

04:48.650 --> 04:50.490
Captain.

04:50.490 --> 04:53.550
I have a plan concerning that.

04:59.230 --> 05:01.760
I couldn't even apologize.

05:01.760 --> 05:05.300
Not even one little "I'm sorry."

05:05.300 --> 05:07.960
I had no time to talk to her.

05:15.810 --> 05:20.710
The Barnette that I'm in love
with is stronger and cuter.

05:25.320 --> 05:26.420
See?

05:26.420 --> 05:28.080
Much better now.

05:48.080 --> 05:50.070
Smile! Smile!

05:53.720 --> 05:57.020
What are you doing?

05:57.020 --> 06:00.920
How can you smile at a time like this?

06:00.920 --> 06:02.120
Because...

06:02.120 --> 06:03.780
I don't know.

06:06.060 --> 06:10.930
I don't know what kind of
face to show when I'm sad.

06:10.930 --> 06:13.230
When I was alone...

06:13.230 --> 06:16.640
When the unit I lived in closed down...

06:16.640 --> 06:20.310
Everyone had sad faces just like now.

06:20.310 --> 06:23.140
But when I made a mistake...

06:23.140 --> 06:26.410
or said something strange,
everyone laughed.

06:30.390 --> 06:33.250
That's why... That's why...

06:33.250 --> 06:36.390
I don't want everyone to stay so sad!

06:36.390 --> 06:38.690
Because I want
everyone to keep laughing...

06:45.530 --> 06:47.190
Why?

06:48.500 --> 06:51.440
Why didn't you save Ms. Gasco?

06:51.440 --> 06:53.110
What was that?

06:53.110 --> 06:56.510
You should've been able to do it.

06:56.510 --> 06:58.580
Are you saying it's my fault?

06:58.580 --> 07:01.020
You always brag about things

07:01.020 --> 07:04.450
but when it counts,
you're completely useless!

07:04.450 --> 07:05.620
Damn you!

07:05.620 --> 07:07.520
Stop it, both of you!

07:16.560 --> 07:20.300
Here, it's your turn.

07:20.300 --> 07:22.860
Show me your hand.

07:33.650 --> 07:34.620
Yeah...

07:34.620 --> 07:37.150
I'll show you.

07:37.150 --> 07:38.750
Gather everyone here!

07:38.750 --> 07:40.650
For a tactical meeting!

07:44.590 --> 07:45.960
It's stable.

07:45.960 --> 07:48.120
What happened so suddenly?

07:53.600 --> 07:55.340
We can analyze this one.

07:55.340 --> 07:56.840
What's going on?

07:56.840 --> 07:59.000
Hurry up and treat me!

08:00.210 --> 08:02.980
Hibiki Tokai...

08:02.980 --> 08:04.640
Who are you?

08:06.080 --> 08:07.320
What do you want?

08:07.320 --> 08:11.050
I thought of a way to shut
down the enemy's mothership.

08:11.050 --> 08:12.890
What's that?

08:12.890 --> 08:14.420
This.

08:14.420 --> 08:17.560
That's the thing from Pluto...

08:17.560 --> 08:20.260
Right, a virus that feasts on Paksis.

08:20.260 --> 08:21.500
This can hit it.

08:21.500 --> 08:23.200
- Is it ready?
- It's perfect.

08:23.200 --> 08:26.600
All that's left is to have him eat it.

08:26.600 --> 08:28.070
I didn't hear about this!

08:28.070 --> 08:30.340
I don't want to be
separated from Pyoro-2!

08:30.340 --> 08:31.910
Her name is Kahlua!

08:31.910 --> 08:34.540
In other words, you're going
to take Pyoro inside

08:34.540 --> 08:37.980
and directly access the enemy system.

08:37.980 --> 08:42.380
But to infiltrate the ship,
we need to get past the cubes.

08:42.380 --> 08:45.350
- What about them?
- Nothing to worry about!

08:45.350 --> 08:46.820
I knew this'd happen

08:46.820 --> 08:49.760
and I've been thinking
of something for a while.

08:49.760 --> 08:52.590
I call it "Panickun"!

08:52.590 --> 08:53.830
The enemy's a machine

08:53.830 --> 08:56.700
and is controlled remotely
from the mothership.

08:56.700 --> 09:01.100
So if we sever that link,
we'll have time to infiltrate it.

09:01.100 --> 09:03.910
Though it can only sever
the link for a moment.

09:03.910 --> 09:06.470
It's enough to get through!

09:06.470 --> 09:07.540
All right.

09:07.540 --> 09:09.510
Leave the follow-up to me!

09:10.610 --> 09:12.650
All right...

09:12.650 --> 09:14.220
Let's give it a shot!

09:14.220 --> 09:15.880
- Yeah!
- No...

09:20.790 --> 09:22.660
Pyoro-2...

09:22.660 --> 09:24.460
Don't cry, it's obnoxious!

09:24.460 --> 09:26.590
Parfet, is the main cannon fine?

09:26.590 --> 09:29.260
The Paksis has revived to 70%.

09:29.260 --> 09:32.130
It's gotten back to where it's usable!

09:32.130 --> 09:33.600
All right!

09:33.600 --> 09:36.040
It looks like everyone's
looking up again.

09:36.040 --> 09:39.140
Better to keep your
head up in tough situations

09:39.140 --> 09:41.940
than looking down in depression.

09:41.940 --> 09:45.400
We still have our lives, after all.

09:52.750 --> 09:53.720
Let's go.

09:53.720 --> 09:54.890
Start the mission!

09:54.890 --> 09:58.020
- Roger!
- Pyoro-2...

10:07.770 --> 10:09.430
Not yet...

10:13.740 --> 10:15.070
Now!

10:20.180 --> 10:21.840
It's working, Parfet!

10:23.320 --> 10:25.510
- Hibiki, time to combine!
- Right!

10:34.430 --> 10:36.230
They're sure lively when awake.

10:36.230 --> 10:37.530
Dita! Barnette!

10:37.530 --> 10:39.290
- Follow my lead!
- Roger!

10:41.040 --> 10:43.030
You're in the way!

10:45.140 --> 10:46.540
That you, Bart?

10:49.080 --> 10:50.880
Leave all the weaker ones to me!

10:50.880 --> 10:53.570
But aren't these all the weaker ones?

10:57.120 --> 11:00.320
I can't see space...

11:00.320 --> 11:02.880
W-Well, let's get to it!

11:12.030 --> 11:14.500
Pilot safely!

11:15.800 --> 11:16.770
Right over there!

11:16.770 --> 11:18.930
Go!

11:21.140 --> 11:22.710
Dita, follow the lead!

11:22.710 --> 11:24.080
Roger!

11:31.590 --> 11:36.550
Infiltration team has made it
inside the enemy mothership!

11:42.700 --> 11:44.630
No!

11:53.970 --> 11:55.880
Keep going straight.

11:55.880 --> 11:58.940
Nowhere to go except forward!

12:01.350 --> 12:02.420
Barnette?

12:02.420 --> 12:04.420
D-Don't worry.

12:04.420 --> 12:06.690
I'll catch up so go on ahead!

12:06.690 --> 12:08.360
Don't overwork yourself!

12:08.360 --> 12:11.020
The infiltration squad
will reach the center soon.

12:28.540 --> 12:29.780
So this is it?

12:29.780 --> 12:32.410
Barnette and I will take on the enemy.

12:32.410 --> 12:33.880
I trust you to guard Pyoro!

12:33.880 --> 12:36.920
Yeah, do your best!

12:36.920 --> 12:37.920
You hear that?

12:37.920 --> 12:39.050
You're up next!

12:39.050 --> 12:40.710
Right!

12:46.590 --> 12:48.360
Swim, swim, swim!

12:52.830 --> 12:54.340
Pyoro, are you all right?

12:54.340 --> 12:56.330
Leave it to me!

12:59.440 --> 13:01.470
Found it!

13:04.480 --> 13:06.810
- Not yet?
- Pyoro!

13:08.080 --> 13:09.740
Below us!

13:14.860 --> 13:17.590
You're all annoying!

13:31.340 --> 13:32.470
Leave it to me!

13:32.470 --> 13:34.130
Leader!

13:42.480 --> 13:44.250
Pyoro!

13:44.250 --> 13:46.410
J-Just a little bit more...

13:52.690 --> 13:53.660
Jura!

13:53.660 --> 13:55.060
Don't take your time.

13:55.060 --> 13:56.460
Hurry up and finish it!

13:56.460 --> 13:58.430
Don't be reckless.

13:58.430 --> 14:00.770
Your painkillers won't last long.

14:00.770 --> 14:02.240
I know.

14:02.240 --> 14:04.610
That's why I told them to hurry.

14:04.610 --> 14:06.870
You're taking away all the good parts!

14:06.870 --> 14:09.080
We'll divert their attention.

14:09.080 --> 14:12.950
You two aim for that thing's feet!

14:12.950 --> 14:15.350
I get it. Not a bad idea.

14:15.350 --> 14:17.010
Go!

14:29.860 --> 14:30.800
Pyoro!

14:30.800 --> 14:34.400
If you don't hurry, we'll take
care of them before you do!

14:34.400 --> 14:36.840
What an annoying guy...
Just you watch.

14:36.840 --> 14:38.900
Launch the virus!

14:47.410 --> 14:48.780
It's in pain...

14:48.780 --> 14:50.440
It worked!

14:53.520 --> 14:55.960
The enemy mothership and cubes

14:55.960 --> 14:58.460
all have lost control!

14:58.460 --> 15:00.720
Pyoro did it!

15:02.000 --> 15:05.400
Now, about those kids inside...

15:06.770 --> 15:09.200
All right! Let's hurry out of here!

15:09.200 --> 15:10.200
Roger!

15:10.200 --> 15:12.770
We'll pick up Pyoro now!

15:12.770 --> 15:15.580
Hey! Hurry up and pick me up!

15:15.580 --> 15:17.980
I'll hold a grudge if you don't!

15:17.980 --> 15:19.640
Sheesh...

15:26.150 --> 15:27.140
No!

15:35.560 --> 15:37.220
Guys!

15:42.840 --> 15:44.270
Barnette...

15:44.270 --> 15:45.440
Go.

15:45.440 --> 15:48.210
That noisy Pyoro is getting in the way.

15:48.210 --> 15:49.180
I can't!

15:49.180 --> 15:51.080
I can't leave you all here!

15:51.080 --> 15:52.680
It's all right!

15:52.680 --> 15:56.020
We won't lose.

15:56.020 --> 16:02.520
I don't want everyone to
have sad faces ever again.

16:02.520 --> 16:04.180
Dita...

16:10.830 --> 16:12.820
Hurry up and go!

16:14.970 --> 16:17.160
I can't!

16:22.910 --> 16:26.410
I-Infiltration squad's
signal has been lost...

16:26.410 --> 16:30.350
I can't catch any signals
other than Barnette's.

16:54.480 --> 16:57.670
I'm in the center?

17:02.480 --> 17:04.050
Can it be?

17:04.050 --> 17:07.150
All the Dreads fused together...

17:07.150 --> 17:09.380
What a situation we have...

17:14.430 --> 17:15.630
Incredible...

17:15.630 --> 17:19.970
I can feel the immense power of this guy!

17:19.970 --> 17:22.370
Amazing! Amazing! Amazing!

17:22.370 --> 17:25.040
This is beyond all reason...

17:25.040 --> 17:28.040
What is this?

17:28.040 --> 17:31.170
I control all this by myself?

17:37.320 --> 17:40.650
Hey! Stop spacing out and fight back!

17:42.060 --> 17:43.060
Geez!

17:43.060 --> 17:45.620
I'm wounded, remember?

17:51.730 --> 17:54.130
A-Amazing...

17:54.130 --> 17:56.240
This is worth something.

17:56.240 --> 17:59.970
Let's show them our true power!

18:11.290 --> 18:13.950
Go!

18:32.440 --> 18:36.780
Enemy fleet has lost control,
and all functions have shut down.

18:36.780 --> 18:39.370
Enemy mothership has become silent.

18:40.780 --> 18:42.440
We did it!

18:43.450 --> 18:45.510
Amazing, little children.

18:50.660 --> 18:53.090
I wonder if I'll fuse with them.

18:58.900 --> 19:00.560
Back then...

19:01.440 --> 19:05.840
The Paksis didn't lend a
helping hand against hatred.

19:05.840 --> 19:10.110
But it was the Paksis that
fused all the ships together.

19:10.110 --> 19:12.510
It was because our thoughts were one.

19:12.510 --> 19:16.680
We were optimistic and
wanted to live through this.

19:16.680 --> 19:19.280
That's why it was born.

19:22.860 --> 19:23.920
Captain.

19:23.920 --> 19:27.860
The entire crew is asking
for a funeral for Gascogne.

19:29.230 --> 19:30.330
All right.

19:30.330 --> 19:32.970
BC, I leave the details of it to you.

19:32.970 --> 19:35.100
Call me when things are ready.

19:35.100 --> 19:36.760
Roger.

19:38.070 --> 19:41.510
- I feel so sorry for the captain.
- There's no surprise there.

19:41.510 --> 19:46.410
Ms. Gasco was her partner ever
since she became a pirate.

19:46.410 --> 19:49.850
Though she was a reliable sister to us

19:49.850 --> 19:52.750
she was a daughter to the captain.

19:53.920 --> 19:56.390
I see...

19:56.390 --> 19:59.050
That's true.

20:07.400 --> 20:09.060
Come in.

20:32.730 --> 20:34.230
How is it?

20:34.230 --> 20:36.220
Isn't it a good hand?

20:53.180 --> 20:55.520
- Vice-captain.
- What is it?

20:55.520 --> 20:58.450
I'll be rewriting the security codes now.

20:58.450 --> 21:03.090
You won't be able to use the Reg system.

21:03.090 --> 21:04.220
Understood.

21:04.220 --> 21:05.460
What does it mean?

21:05.460 --> 21:07.360
She's started already.

21:08.900 --> 21:10.560
A wonderful choice.

21:10.560 --> 21:11.570
That's not true.

21:11.570 --> 21:13.860
She volunteered.

21:16.770 --> 21:19.710
It was too early for Gascogne to go...

21:19.710 --> 21:23.310
But to have someone
to follow in her footsteps...

21:23.310 --> 21:27.010
Perhaps she lived a very happy life.
